CC0 1.0 Universal

Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer exclusive Copyright and Related Rights upon the creator and subsequent owner(s). Certain owners wish to permanently relinquish those rights to contribute to a commons of creative, cultural, and scientific works that the public can reliably build upon.

To the extent possible under law, the person who associated CC0 with this work has waived all Copyright and Related Rights to this work worldwide. The work is provided without warranty. See the full legal code at https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode.
